{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22353","headline":"酬李少府曹长官舍见赠 · 白居易","name":"酬李少府曹长官舍见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"低腰复敛手，心体不遑安。\n一落风尘下，方知爲吏难。\n公事与日长，宦情随岁阑。\n惆怅青袍袖，芸香无半残。\n赖有李夫子，此怀聊自宽。\n两心如止水，彼此无波澜。\n往往簿书暇，相劝强爲欢。\n白马晚蹋雪，渌觞春暖寒。\n恋月夜同宿，爱山晴共看。\n野性自相近，不是爲同官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}